  "sourceAccountId": "ACC-10001",
  "destinationAccountId": "ACC-30001",
  "amount": 99.95,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "reference": "Rent October"
}

### Episode 05 — read it back -> 200 (paste the paymentId from the response above)
@paymentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{paymentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Episode 05 — unknown payment -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

