Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: episode-08-request-2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "ACC-10001",
  "destinationAccountId": "ACC-20001",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "reference": "Invoice 12345"
}

### Episode 09 — create a payment to execute -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: episode-09-request-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "ACC-10001",
  "destinationAccountId": "ACC-20001",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "reference": "Invoice 12345"
}

### Episode 09 — execute it -> 200 "COMPLETED" (since Episode 17: 202 "CREATED", then GET shows COMPLETED) (paste the paymentId from the response above)
@executePaymentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{executePaymentId}}/execute
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Episode 09 — execute it again -> 409 "is COMPLETED and cannot become PROCESSING"
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{executePaymentId}}/execute
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Episode 09 — a payment the stub payment system rejects -> 201, then execute it -> 200 "FAILED" (since Episode 17: 202, then GET shows FAILED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: episode-09-request-2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "ACC-10001",
  "destinationAccountId": "ACC-20001",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "reference": "REJECT insufficient funds"
}

