{
  "sourceAccountId": "ACC-10001",
  "destinationAccountId": "ACC-20001",
  "amount": 10000.01,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "reference": "Invoice 12013"
}

### Episode 12 — execute it -> 422 "exceeds the source account's limit", payment is now AUTHORIZED (since Episode 17: 202, then GET shows AUTHORIZED) (paste the paymentId above)
@overLimitPaymentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{overLimitPaymentId}}/execute
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

