GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus

### Episode 16 — create a payment the payment system settles, but answers too late -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: episode-16-demo-key-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "ACC-10001",
  "destinationAccountId": "ACC-20001",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "reference": "TIMEOUT Invoice 16016"
}

### Episode 16 — execute it -> after 5s, 200 with "status": "PROCESSING" (outcome unknown); again -> 409 (since Episode 17: 202 at once; GET shows PROCESSING) (paste the paymentId above)
@unknownOutcomePaymentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{unknownOutcomePaymentId}}/execute
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Episode 16 — circuit breaker states (after `docker compose stop account-system` and a few creates, account-system is open)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus

### Episode 17 — create a payment to execute asynchronously -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: episode-17-demo-key-1
X-Correlation-Id: episode-17-demo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "ACC-10001",
  "destinationAccountId": "ACC-20001",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "reference": "Invoice 17017"
}

### Episode 17 — execute it -> 202 with "status": "CREATED": queued, not done yet (paste the paymentId above)
@asyncPaymentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{asyncPaymentId}}/execute
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-Id: episode-17-demo

### Episode 17 — follow it -> 200 "COMPLETED" a moment later; the consumer's log lines carry correlationId episode-17-demo
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{asyncPaymentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Episode 17 — execute it again -> 409 "is COMPLETED and cannot become PROCESSING", nothing is queued
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{asyncPaymentId}}/execute
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Episode 17 — broker down (`docker compose stop kafka`): execute a payment that is still CREATED -> 503 "Message broker is unavailable" after 2s
@brokerDownPaymentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{brokerDownPaymentId}}/execute
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bonus 01 — no token -> 401, WWW-Authenticate: Bearer
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Bonus 01 — health, metrics and the API docs need no token -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Bonus 01 — create as CUST-1001 -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: bonus-01-demo-key-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "ACC-10001",
  "destinationAccountId": "ACC-30001",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "reference": "Invoice B0101"
}

### Bonus 01 — read it as CUST-2002 -> 404, the same answer as for a payment that doesn't exist (paste the paymentId above)
@securedPaymentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{securedPaymentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{otherToken}}

### Bonus 01 — execute or cancel it as CUST-2002 -> 404, nothing changes
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{securedPaymentId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{otherToken}}

### Bonus 01 — CUST-2002 pays from CUST-1001's account -> 403 "is not held by the caller"
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{otherToken}}
Idempotency-Key: bonus-01-demo-key-2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "ACC-10001",
  "destinationAccountId": "ACC-30001",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "reference": "Invoice B0102"
}

### Bonus 01 — CUST-2002 reuses CUST-1001's Idempotency-Key from its own account -> 201, a new payment: keys are per customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{otherToken}}
Idempotency-Key: bonus-01-demo-key-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "ACC-30001",
  "destinationAccountId": "ACC-10001",
  "amount": 99.95,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "reference": "Invoice B0103"
}

### Bonus 02 — the Episode 16 TIMEOUT payment, about 3 minutes after executing it -> 200 "COMPLETED": reconciliation asked the payment system
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{unknownOutcomePaymentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bonus 02 — reconciliation counters -> payments_reconciled_total{result="executed"}
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus

### Bonus 03 — events waiting for the relay -> payment_events_pending 0.0 (1.0 or more while Kafka is stopped)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus

### Bonus 04 — a COMPLETED payment to refund: paste the paymentId of an executed payment (Episode 09)
@refundPaymentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Bonus 04 — refund part of it -> 201 "COMPLETED"
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{refundPaymentId}}/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: bonus-04-demo-refund-1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100.00, "currency": "EUR" }

### Bonus 04 — the same request again -> 201, the same refundId: nothing is sent twice
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{refundPaymentId}}/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: bonus-04-demo-refund-1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100.00, "currency": "EUR" }

### Bonus 04 — the rest -> 201 "COMPLETED"
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{refundPaymentId}}/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: bonus-04-demo-refund-2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 150.00, "currency": "EUR" }

### Bonus 04 — one cent more -> 422 "exceeds the 0.00 EUR left to refund"
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{refundPaymentId}}/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: bonus-04-demo-refund-3
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 0.01, "currency": "EUR" }

### Bonus 04 — its refunds -> 200, two refunds, oldest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{refundPaymentId}}/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bonus 04 — CUST-2002 tries -> 404: not their payment
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{refundPaymentId}}/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{otherToken}}

### Bonus 04 — on a fresh COMPLETED payment, 13.13 the stub payment system rejects -> 201 "FAILED"
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{executePaymentId}}/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: bonus-04-demo-refund-4
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 13.13, "currency": "EUR" }

### Bonus 04 — refund counters -> refunds_total{status="completed"}
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus

### Bonus 09 — ACC-10001's statement -> 200, settled payments newest first, with what was refunded of each
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-10001/statement
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bonus 09 — only COMPLETED ones, 5 per page, the second page (from= and to= take days: 2026-10-10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-10001/statement?status=COMPLETED&size=5&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bonus 09 — CUST-2002 asks for it -> 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-10001/statement
Authorization: Bearer {{otherToken}}

### Bonus 09 — more than 100 per page -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-10001/statement?size=500
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bonus 10 — ACC-10001's statement -> each line now has "reference" (null for payments settled before Bonus 10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-10001/statement
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bonus 10 — the versions of payment-events' schema in the registry (the relay registers it on its first send)
GET http://localhost:8085/apis/registry/v3/groups/default/artifacts/payment-events-value/versions

### Bonus 10 — the latest one: the schema in src/main/avro/PaymentEvent.avsc
GET http://localhost:8085/apis/registry/v3/groups/default/artifacts/payment-events-value/versions/branch=latest/content
